CommitDate: Wed Oct 21 08:10:02 2026 +0200

    Speed up exact V4.1 prefill matmuls and indexer scores on M3
    
    - V4.1 BF16 Q8 matmuls on M3 Ultra take the existing unpack-then-F16-GEMM
      path when the batch is wide: +0.6-0.8% prefill, bit-identical.
    - kernel_dsv41_indexer_scores_mma keeps each simdgroup's K^T fragments in
      registers and reads Q and head weights from device memory, so the head
      loop runs without threadgroup memory or barriers. Products, block order
      and head sum order match the tiled F32 kernel: bit-identical scores,
      1.31 -> 0.77 s at 16K.
    
    Together, cold prefill 32K 860 -> 892 t/s and 64K 853 -> 898 t/s.
    DS4_QWEN4_Q8_PREFILL_UNPACK=0 and DS4_METAL_DISABLE_V41_INDEX_MMA=1 roll
    them back.

